## User Steps

- [ ] ask them to upload additional example notes to the portal

## User Workflow

1. User uploads audio in note taking inbox
2. Upload goes to azure blob
3. FE hits py API with blob ID
4. py API kicks off transcription job
5. job generates model which appears in the UI

